note.p:
The Advisory Board was established in pursuance of Section 409 of Title IV of the
                    Foreign Economic Assistance Act of 1950 (Public Law 535), approved June 5, 1950;
                    for text of the act, see 64 Stat. 198. For additional information, see
                    Department of State Bulletin, December 4, 1950, p.
                    880; 
                        ibid., December 18, 1950, pp. 973–974.
